cff-version: 1.2.0
title: US LLC State Requirements Dataset
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it. When citing a specific
  figure, include that record's own lastVerified date, because state
  fees and rules change.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Dikyurt
    given-names: Muhammet
    affiliation: StartupSole LLC
repository-code: https://github.com/startupsolellc/us-llc-fees-dataset
url: https://github.com/startupsolellc/us-llc-fees-dataset
abstract: >-
  An open, machine-readable dataset of United States limited liability
  company formation costs, naming rules, and assumed-name (DBA) filing
  rules, covering all 50 states and the District of Columbia. Fields
  include formation and annual report fees, LLC name designators, the
  distinguishability standard, restricted words, name reservation cost,
  hold period and processing time, DBA terminology, filing level, fees
  and renewal rules, and the governing statutes. Every field is
  hand-verified against official state government sources, and every
  record carries its sources and the date it was last verified.
keywords:
  - limited liability company
  - business registration
  - company formation
  - business names
  - assumed name
  - fictitious business name
  - state statutes
  - United States
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: '2026-07-25'
